  <data name="BeginJourneyHeading" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Begin your Dutch journey</value>
  </data>
  <data name="BeginJourneyParagraph" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Ready to dive into Dutch culture, connect with locals, and unlock new opportunities? Whether you've just arrived or you're aiming to deepen your roots here, mastering Dutch is your gateway. From acing your integration exams to feeling at home in The Netherlands, we've got your back. Join us and start speaking Dutch with confidence today!</value>
  </data>
  <data name="BookConsultation" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Book Your Free Consultation</value>
  </data>
  <data name="Contact" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Contact</value>
  </data>
  <data name="FreeConsultation" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Free consultation</value>
  </data>
  <data name="Heading" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Expat Support &amp; Mentoring</value>
  </data>
  <data name="MoreInfoHeading" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Need More Information?</value>
  </data>
  <data name="MoreInfoParagraph" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Discover how our tailored guidance can help you achieve your goals with a free 30-minute consultation.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="Paragraph1" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>So yes, there is the language. And depending on your origin and situation, there is also ‘inburgering’. With regard to all the inburgeringsexamens (civilisation exams) you can reach out to us as well!</value>
  </data>
  <data name="Paragraph2" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>But there are a million things to sort out and to arrange; housing, finding a job, education, schools for your children, getting around, understanding the laws/rules, drivers licenses…</value>
  </data>
  <data name="Paragraph3" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>When you do not master the language (yet!), this can be quite a hurdle, especially in The Netherlands, where rules and regulations not only create structure and safety but also confusion and miscommunication.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="Paragraph4" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>We’ve been living abroad ourselves in different countries. We feel you. Things can be a lot easier and less frustrating if there’s someone to guide you through it.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="Paragraph5" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>You can ask for advice or support on specific issues, or we can offer our support for a dedicated period. It’s up to you. There’s always someone in our network who can answer your questions, support you in a process or to help you solve problems.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="Title" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Your Guide to Thriving in a New Country</value>
  </data>
  <data name="TryLevelTest" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Try level test for free</value>
